cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository currently documents an in-progress research protocol
  and design artifacts (experimental protocol, vocabulary rationale,
  metadata schemas, preprocessing plan) — it is NOT yet a dataset, since
  no EEG data has been collected. type is set to "software" rather than
  "dataset" for this reason. Update type to "dataset" (and complete the
  fields below) only once an actual dataset exists and is released.
title: "Hindi Imagined-Speech EEG Dataset for Thought-to-Text and Mental Health Applications"
type: software
status: in-development
